conflict-clear        | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/label-conflict-90.jq | | label-clear | n=90
# ── homelab#2476 / FU-290 (2026-10-10 19:00Z): label writes ride REST (`gh api -X POST/DELETE
# .../labels`), never `gh pr edit --add-label|--remove-label` (GraphQL). STUB_GH_GRAPHQL=drained
# (agents/replay/stubs/gh) models the drained GraphQL pool: EVERY GraphQL mutation fails with gh's
# "API rate limit already exceeded for installation ID 142724430" while REST serves (first cut,
# #2483: a per-call STUB_GH_pr_edit_90=fail, which drained only that one call shape). The script
# never issues a GraphQL mutation on this leg, so these rows assert the SAME clean stream as
# conflict-dirty/conflict-clear above; RED on the pre-#2476 source (`gh pr edit --add-label`).
conflict-dirty-graphql-drained | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/dirty-90.jq          | STUB_GH_GRAPHQL=drained | dirty-label | n=90
conflict-clear-graphql-drained | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/label-conflict-90.jq | STUB_GH_GRAPHQL=drained | label-clear | n=90
